  "$comment": "Poimandres. Source: https://github.com/drcmda/poimandres-theme. Licence: MIT. No orange and no purple: pink2 and blue stand in. accent = teal, link = blue2 #add7ff, red = pink #d0679d (the theme's error colour).",
